# Claude Code instructions live at .claude/CLAUDE.md, not the repo root. Pages
# serves whatever is in the branch, so a root CLAUDE.md gets published at
# diffusiondj.com/CLAUDE.md — dot-directories are not served.
/CLAUDE.md

# Codex reads this from disk; committing it would publish it at the site root
# for the same reason as /CLAUDE.md above.
/AGENTS.md

# Codex's per-directory MCP config. Machine-local, and it carries absolute
# paths to this machine's Claude Extensions directory.
.codex/

# Machine-local permissions and preferences.
.claude/settings.local.json
